DESCRIPTION:We’re throwing an extra cool party for National Ice Cream Day 🍦 \n📍 Sunday\, July 19 | all day\n📍 600 Foster St. (LocoShop)\nAND\n📍 2618 Hillsborough Rd. (LocoPops) \nHere’s what’s poppin:\n🍨 Design your dream ice cream flavor\, winner gets on the menu (!!)\n🍰 Ice Cream Pie by the Slice\n🌻 Raffles\n🎨 Free crafts for kids (and adults!) \nFamily-friendly\, and full of summer joy 💛 Come stay cool with us!
