SUMMARY:Yoga at Motorco Music Hall
DESCRIPTION:Let’s rise\, gather\, and yoga flow together! This isn’t your typical yoga studio class. It’s casual\, community-driven\, and happens to be in one of the coolest rooms in downtown Durham. Whether you’re a seasoned yogi or just looking for a new reason to get out of bed on a Saturday morning\, this one’s for you! \nEach ticket includes: One 60-minute all levels yoga session led by an experienced\, local yoga studio owner\, raffle entry\, and a drink token redeemable next door at the Parts & Labor bar. EARLY BIRD SPECIAL: Bring a friend for the price of one! See link for tickets.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/yoga-at-motorco-music-hall/
LOCATION:Motorco\, 723 Rigsbee\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
